# SwiftFormat configuration for Yappy
#
# FORMAT: this file uses SwiftFormat's own `--flag value` syntax, one per line.
# It is NOT YAML. A previous version was written as YAML (`indent: "    "`,
# `wrapArguments: false`, …) with 7 of its 8 keys not being real SwiftFormat
# options at all. SwiftFormat rejected it outright ("Unknown option 'version:'")
# and, because the CI step was `continue-on-error`, that failure was invisible —
# so the formatter never actually ran on this codebase.
#
# RULE SCOPE: `--rules` opts IN to an explicit set instead of running
# SwiftFormat's full default suite. The default suite wants to reformat 128 of
# 134 files — a whole-codebase rewrite that would erase `git blame` for marginal
# benefit. The set below is whitespace hygiene only: behaviour-neutral and
# reviewable. Widen it deliberately, one rule at a time, rather than by deleting
# this line.

--swiftversion 5.9
--indent 4

--rules trailingSpace,consecutiveBlankLines,consecutiveSpaces,linebreakAtEndOfFile,blankLinesAtEndOfScope

# One-off build utilities and generated output — not app code. Mirrors the
# `excluded:` list in .swiftlint.yml; keep the two in sync.
--exclude Scripts,dist,.derivedData,.build-home,DerivedData
